<p>The <b>VersionCategory</b> template simplifies creation of the version-specific categories generated by the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Template%20-%20Constant%20table%20start" title="Template:Constant table start">Constant</a> and <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Template%20-%20Function" title="Template:Function (page does not exist)">Function</a> templates.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Usage">Usage</span></h2>
<pre>
{{VersionCategory
|type    = function
|version = 1.02
}}</pre>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Example">Example</span></h2>
<p>The <b>1.02 functions</b> category lists functions added by the <a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://social.bioware.com/page/da-patches">Dragon Age:Origins 1.02 patch</a>.
</p>
